      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently highlight the helpfulness of both the front desk staff and veterinary clinicians at East Market. Reviewers note that groomers like Amber and Alyssa build genuine connections with animals and communicate clearly with owners. Clients describe a welcoming atmosphere where staff listen carefully to health and styling preferences."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle approach for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the calm handling shown towards frightened cats and high-energy or reactive dogs. Several clients mention that groomers successfully trimmed nails without muzzles by utilizing gentle distraction and patience. Pet owners report that their animals settle quickly in the exam rooms and feel safe during procedures."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dependable grooming and wellness results"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients express great satisfaction with both veterinary treatments and styling sessions for dogs and cats. Reviews mention clean coat cuts, precise nail dremeling, and prompt post-visit follow-up from the veterinary team. Pet parents report that their companions return home healthy, comfortable, and neatly groomed."
      }
    }
  ],
